              <h3>多轨故事编辑器</h3>
              <p>基于时间线的多声音叙事编辑器。自由编排轨道、修剪片段并混合不同角色之间的对话，快速制作播客与有声内容。</p>
            </article>

            <article class="cap-cell">
              <div class="cap-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8">
                  <line x1="4" x2="4" y1="21" y2="14" />
                  <line x1="4" x2="4" y1="10" y2="3" />
                  <line x1="12" x2="12" y1="21" y2="12" />
                  <line x1="12" x2="12" y1="8" y2="3" />
                  <line x1="20" x2="20" y1="21" y2="16" />
                  <line x1="20" x2="20" y1="12" y2="3" />
                  <line x1="2" x2="6" y1="14" y2="14" />
                  <line x1="10" x2="14" y1="8" y2="8" />
                  <line x1="18" x2="22" y1="16" y2="16" />
                </svg>
              </div>
              <h3>实时音频效果管线</h3>
              <p>自由串联变调、混响、延迟与压缩效果并保存为预设。支持实时试听，也可为每个声音配置文件绑定默认效果链。</p>
            </article>

            <article class="cap-cell">
              <div class="cap-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8">
                  <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" />
                  <path d="M3 12h18" />
                  <path d="M12 3a14 14 0 0 1 0 18" />
                  <path d="M12 3a14 14 0 0 0 0 18" />
                </svg>
              </div>
              <h3>本地加速或远程算力</h3>
              <p>支持 Metal、CUDA、ROCm、Intel Arc 与 DirectML 本地加速，也可一键连接局域网或远程推理服务器并自动发现。</p>
            </article>

            <article class="cap-cell">
              <div class="cap-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8">
                  <path d="M4 7V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8.5L20 7.5V20a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H4" />
                  <polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8" />
                  <path d="M2 15h10" />
                  <path d="M5 12l-3 3 3 3" />
                </svg>
              </div>
              <h3>长文本自动分段合成</h3>
              <p>单次最多支持 50,000 字符。文本会在句子边界自动切分、逐块生成并平滑交叉淡入淡出，整章朗读一气呵成。</p>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

