      <!-- VOICE CLONING -->
      <section id="cloning" class="section">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="clone-layout">
            <div class="section-head">
              <h2 class="section-title">三秒样本，克隆任意声线</h2>
              <p class="section-desc">
                支持三种声音采样方式：上传音频文件、麦克风直接录制，或捕获系统正在播放的音频。如果不希望克隆，也可直接使用内置 50+ 预设音色。
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="clone-list">
              <div class="clone-row">
                <div class="clone-row-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                  <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8">
                    <path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4" />
                    <polyline points="17 8 12 3 7 8" />
                    <line x1="12" x2="12" y1="3" y2="15" />
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <h3>上传音频文件</h3>
                  <p>拖放 WAV、MP3、FLAC 或 WebM 片段即可提取声纹特征，无需繁琐预处理。</p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="clone-row">
                <div class="clone-row-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                  <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8">
                    <path d="M12 2a3 3 0 0 0-3 3v7a3 3 0 0 0 6 0V5a3 3 0 0 0-3-3Z" />
                    <path d="M19 10v2a7 7 0 0 1-14 0v-2" />
                    <line x1="12" x2="12" y1="19" y2="22" />
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <h3>麦克风实时录制</h3>
                  <p>录制时提供实时波形反馈，最长支持 30 秒采样，轻松建立个人声库。</p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="clone-row">
                <div class="clone-row-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                  <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8">
                    <rect x="2" y="3" width="20" height="14" rx="2" />
                    <line x1="8" x2="16" y1="21" y2="21" />
                    <line x1="12" x2="12" y1="17" y2="21" />
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <h3>系统音频捕获</h3>
                  <p>直接从视频、播客或任何正在播放声音的应用中捕获清晰参考片段。</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

