          <div class="engine-list" id="engineList">
            <div class="engine-row" data-category="clone">
              <div>
                <div class="engine-name">Qwen3-TTS</div>
                <span class="engine-by">阿里巴巴</span>
              </div>
              <p class="engine-desc">高质量多语言语音克隆与自然韵律，支持用自然语言指令控制语调、节奏与情感。</p>
              <div class="engine-meta tabular">1.7B / 0.6B · 10 种语言</div>
            </div>

            <div class="engine-row" data-category="preset">
              <div>
                <div class="engine-name">Qwen CustomVoice</div>
                <span class="engine-by">阿里巴巴</span>
              </div>
              <p class="engine-desc">内置 9 种精选预设音色，无需参考音频即可开声，并支持自然语言语气控制。</p>
              <div class="engine-meta tabular">9 种预设音色 · 10 种语言</div>
            </div>

            <div class="engine-row" data-category="preset">
              <div>
                <div class="engine-name">Qwen VoiceDesign</div>
                <span class="engine-by">阿里巴巴</span>
              </div>
              <p class="engine-desc">写一段文字描述就能创造全新声线，不需要参考音频或预设音色，适合定制角色声音。</p>
              <div class="engine-meta tabular">文字造声 · 10 种语言</div>
            </div>

            <div class="engine-row" data-category="clone">
              <div>
                <div class="engine-name">Chatterbox</div>
                <span class="engine-by">Resemble AI</span>
              </div>
              <p class="engine-desc">生产级零样本语音克隆，覆盖最广泛的 23 种语言，支持精细的情感夸张度控制。</p>
              <div class="engine-meta tabular">23 种语言 · 零样本克隆</div>
            </div>

            <div class="engine-row" data-category="clone fast">
              <div>
                <div class="engine-name">Chatterbox Turbo</div>
                <span class="engine-by">Resemble AI</span>
              </div>
              <p class="engine-desc">轻量快速，支持在文本中嵌入 [laugh]、[sigh]、[gasp] 等副语言标签，生成富有表现力的语音。</p>
              <div class="engine-meta tabular">350M 参数 · 副语言标签</div>
            </div>

            <div class="engine-row" data-category="clone fast">
              <div>
                <div class="engine-name">LuxTTS</div>
                <span class="engine-by">ZipVoice</span>
              </div>
              <p class="engine-desc">超快速且对 CPU 友好的 48kHz 语音克隆。仅需约 1GB 显存，CPU 上可达 150 倍实时速度。</p>
              <div class="engine-meta tabular">150x 实时 · 48kHz 输出</div>
            </div>

            <div class="engine-row" data-category="preset fast">
              <div>
                <div class="engine-name">Kokoro</div>
                <span class="engine-by">hexgrad</span>
              </div>
              <p class="engine-desc">微型高效的预设音色引擎。82M 参数提供 50 种精选音色，CPU 推理极快，适合批量生成与草稿。</p>
              <div class="engine-meta tabular">82M 参数 · 50 种预设音色</div>
            </div>

            <div class="engine-row" data-category="fast">
              <div>
                <div class="engine-name">TADA</div>
                <span class="engine-by">HumeAI</span>
              </div>
              <p class="engine-desc">语音语言模型，支持 700 秒以上连贯长音频与文本声学双重对齐，适合长篇叙事。</p>
              <div class="engine-meta tabular">1B / 3B · 700s+ 连贯音频</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
